      "status": "closed",
      "resolvedBy": "TASK-260728-7ii1xz",
      "resolvedIn": "2026-07-28.r4",
      "resolution": "Confirmed as stated and then resolved: the .spec/security-privacy.md shared Data-Protection-Keychain-access-group design does not work between the macOS host and a root provider, and works unchanged on iOS. The replacement is candidate D - the provider owns a file-based system-domain keychain item, seeded once from the host over NETunnelProviderSession.sendProviderMessage. Matrix consequence: macos.provider keychain-access-groups is settled prohibited (rule K1), not pending. Downstream tasks 379cpk, 1o9wjz, 29ws8l, 2hhh7x and 3f4lxy each revise the assumption named in TASK-260728-7ii1xz_macos-credential-transport-decision.md section 8."
    },
